Here are the 20 tools from the zenseai-local MCP server, one by one:

ask_workspace

Lets you ask the workspace for information, guidance, or context-related answers.
create_workspace_ticket

Creates a new ticket or work item inside a workspace for tracking tasks/issues.
delete_workspace_ticket

Deletes an existing workspace ticket.
get_dashboard_summary

Fetches a summary/dashboard view of workspace or project status, metrics, or activity.
get_project_model

Retrieves the model/configuration associated with a specific project.
get_project_workspaces

Gets the list of workspaces linked to a project.
get_user_info

Returns details about the current user or account.
get_workspace_agents

Lists the agents that exist in or are assigned to a workspace.
get_workspace_tickets

Lists the tickets/issues associated with a workspace.
list_my_workspaces

Shows all workspaces the current user has access to.
list_project_models
Lists the models available for a project.
list_project_prompt_templates
Lists reusable prompt templates defined for a project.
list_project_transactions
Shows transaction records or activity logs for a project.
list_projects
Lists the projects available to the user.
manage_workspace
Creates, updates, configures, or manages workspace-level settings or state.
run_agent
Starts or runs an automated agent/workflow in a workspace/project context.
search_zenseai
Searches the ZenseAI system for relevant knowledge, records, or project data.
update_project_model
Updates the model configuration or metadata for a project.
validate_project_workspace_access
Checks whether the current user has valid access to a specific workspace/project.
whoami
Returns identity information about the authenticated user.
get_user_info

Returns the current authenticated user record from the ZenseAI system.
list_projects

Lists all projects the logged-in user can access.
list_my_workspaces

Lists every workspace the user can access, grouped by project.
get_project_workspaces

Fetches all workspaces inside a specific project that the user can access.
validate_project_workspace_access

Checks whether a given project and workspace are valid and accessible to the user.
upload_knowledge_base_documents

Uploads local documents (PDF, DOC, TXT, Excel, PPT, image, etc.) into a workspace’s knowledge base.
delete_knowledge_base_documents

Removes selected knowledge-base documents from a workspace by document name.
create_workspace_codespace

Creates a code space for a workspace from a local ZIP file of source code, usually for code ingestion/analysis.
delete_workspace_codespace

Deletes a specific code space inside a workspace by its name.
get_workspace_tickets

Lists the tickets associated with a specific workspace.
create_workspace_ticket
Creates a new ticket in a workspace from a local Excel/XLS file using a model and prompt settings.
delete_workspace_ticket
Deletes a specific ticket by ticket ID from a workspace.
whoami
Returns identity/context info about the current request and whether an API token is configured.
